item.description:
Suki Waterhouse, an English singer-songwriter, actress and model performed on the Fairbanks Lawn at the Hollywood Forever Cemetery on July 23, marking the second stop of “The Loveland Tour.”&#160;
&#160;
Waterhouse released her third studio album, “Loveland,” on July 10 before kicking off the tour in Phoenix on July 22.&#160;
&#160;
Charlotte Lawrence and her band opened the show with a set that included a cover and an unreleased single.

UCPD arrested a man for indecent exposure near the Luskin School of Public Affairs building Wednesday.
The man was non-compliant with sex offender registration requirements, said Jeffrey Chobanian, the captain of UCPD’s operations bureau, in an emailed statement.&#160;
He added in the statement that the man had a felony arrest warrant with the California Department of Corrections and Rehabilitation for a weapons violation.
